00:05:41.179 --> 00:05:54.979
<v Adam Grandy>Now, the other thing is, is that you're not a developer, but you watch these conferences and you've been doing it for years and you watch all the speakers get up and they have their talks.

00:05:54.979 --> 00:05:56.667
