00:08:18.703 --> 00:08:44.541
<v Adam Grandy>You know, it just comes down to making sure you've got the right gear. A fluid head tripod helps you out. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. It helps you understand your framing, your composition when a person's walking across the stage and you're shooting them live with a camera, making sure you give them lead room and whatnot. And then it just comes down to practice.

